// CFIHOS 2.0: the graph model and sample data
//
// Generated by ../../cypher.py from model.json and sample.json. Edit those and regenerate, rather than this file.
//
// An engineering contractor's handover of the condensate export pumps at the fictional Kestrel Gas Processing Plant.
// Tags P-2001A/B and their motors sit in a process unit and area of the plant, classed by the CFIHOS reference data
// and fulfilled by serialised equipment of a manufacturer's model parts. The purchase order that bought them, the
// spare parts interchangeability record for their mechanical seals, and an as-built vendor data sheet with its
// revision, references and transmittal complete the handover. Codes such as the CFIHOS unique codes are illustrative.
//
// Run it against an empty database of Neo4j 5 or later, Enterprise Edition, for its node key and property existence
// constraints, e.g. with cypher-shell -f model.cypher. It merges every node and relationship, so it can be run again.

// The model: its constraints

